{"path":"io/ios_base/precision","title":"std::ios_base::precision","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ios_base::</span>precision","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/ios_base/precision","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Manages the precision (i.e. how many digits are generated) of floating point output performed by std::num_put::do_put.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">streamsize precision<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">streamsize precision<span class=\"br0\">(</span> streamsize new_precision <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Manages the precision (i.e. how many digits are generated) of floating point output performed by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/num_put/put\">std::num_put::do_put</a></span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns the current precision. </div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Sets the precision to the given one. Returns the previous precision. </div>\n<p>The default precision, as established by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/init\">std::basic_ios::init</a></span>, is 6.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> new_precision\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> new precision setting\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The precision before the call to the function\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu16\">12.345678901234</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The  default precision is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">precision</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span><span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"With default precision d is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">precision</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"With high    precision d is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The  default precision is 6\n&nbsp;\nWith default precision d is 12.3457\nWith high    precision d is 12.345679</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue189\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 189</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>'precision' was defined as 'the number of digits after<br>the decimal point', but it is not correct in some cases\n</td>\n<td>corrected\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/width\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>width</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  manages field width <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setprecision\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setprecision</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  changes floating-point precision <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/ios_base","title":"std::ios_base"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ios_base::precision","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Manages the precision (i.e. how many digits are generated) of floating point output performed by std::num_put::do_put."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"new_precision"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The precision before the call to the function"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"width","note":"manages field width"},{"label":"setprecision","note":"changes floating-point precision"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":194,"codeBlockCount":2}
